	(text_box "I chose MSP430 because it has an exceptionally low current consumption and advanced capacitive touch capabilities.\n\nIt supports both self-capacitance and mutual capacitance modes, and they can even be mixed. The capacitive buttons are on the front panel which can be easily swapped."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
